      "width": 835,
      "height": 137.5,
      "text": "this.head         = the whole node at @A1 → (value = 10, next = @A2)\nthis.head.value   = 10\nthis.head.next    = @A2 (the node with 5)\nthis.tail         = the whole node at @A3 → (value = 16, next = null)\nthis.tail.value   = 16",
